WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
- The kids at school said the Steelers aren’t for real.

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:04.750
- The Steelers are real…if you believe.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.041
- I don’t think this movie ends well, man.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.875
- Did you beat the Chiefs but almost lose to the Jets?

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:09.750
- [Together:] Uh-huh.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.875
- That seems pretty specific, man.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.625
- [Joe Buck:] INTRODUCING: THE 7TH SEED.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:15.250
NOW EVEN BAD TEAMS CAN MAKE THE PLAYOFFS.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.000
- Can we get it, Coach?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:16.875
- [Together:] PLEASE?

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:17.291
- Ehhhh.

00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:18.916
- I WANT IT, I WANT IT, I WANT IT, I—

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:23.000
- I’m here to get one of these fancy seventh seeds—

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.750
- THERE’S ONLY ONE FLUFFING AVAILABLE, AND DADGUMMIT, MY KIDS GET IT.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.916
- Oof! Spider 2 Whyyyyy, man?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.291
- [Announcer:] REMINDER: THE 7TH SEED IS ALSO AVAILABLE IN NFC!

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:32.875
- Vikings  don't want it.
- Uh, yeah, maybe.

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:33.875
- [T.Y. Hilton:] Phil! Over here!

00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:34.916
- Tough friggin’ play…

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:35.875
JACOBY!

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.666
- ♪♪♪ IT’S BEGINNING TO LOOK A LOT LIKE BIG TRUZZ... ♪♪♪

00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:40.166
AHHH!

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:41.750
- This is what my kid deserves.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.375
- Thanks, Dad.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.000
- Not you.

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:47.125
- Aaron Donald hurts more than a pillow fight!

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.625
- Be careful. It’s a choking hazard.

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:52.916
- ♪♪♪ SANTA GRUDEN, TIME FOR ME TO ESTABLISH THE RUN, FOR FUN! ♪♪♪

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.500
- YOU DON’T FLUFFIN' CROSS THIS RIVER.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:55.791
- Man, get off. That's my turkey hole, man!

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:57.000
- I’ll spice up your stew!

00:00:57.041 --> 00:01:00.000
- Wooo! All right, now I gotta get a present for my 61 other kids.

00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:05.000
- Shhhhh.

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.583
- HELP! HELP! THERE’S A STRANGE STEEL WORKER IN MY HOUSE!

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:10.666
- NO, NO, NO! I'M STEELY MCBEAM, I'M YOUR MASCOT.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:11.750
- GET HIM, TJ WATT.

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:15.428
- OWW. OW IT HURTS. CHRISTMAS IS RUINED.

